{"review_md": "# STOP-r4 独立审查\n\n结论：**NEEDS_CHANGES**。候选 `ab308912117dac59cadd5aa2e75b46a418e41b6b` / tree `c45e5bd0a1890c6789ddb590e57d9d7db0f67521` 保持干净；全19路径及r4两路径delta与冻结输入一致。r4的owner/ACE修复获得独立支持，但全19检查发现一项新增P2问题，尚不能接受整个候选。\n\n## STOP-R4-F01：额外 MODEL effect 的 state 缺失/null 会被漏计\n\n位置：`internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows.go:163-165`，调用点 `internal/ownedcorestop/stop_windows.go:119`、`:292`。\n\n当old subject已有一条CONFIRMED MODEL effect，另一个同project/run effect_key的最新记录为 `{\"payload\":{\"capability\":\"MODEL\"}}` 或 `state:null`，SQLite `json_extract` 返回NULL。`IN (...)` 和 `!= 'CONFIRMED'` 都不会计入该行，三个effect计数仍表现为0/0/1，`ExactOldSubjectSafe()`误返true。\n\n独立真实schema24 SQLite + reserved writer复现了missing/null两例。16项有限矩阵中仅这两项失败：bool、number、array、object、empty、unknown enum、额外CONFIRMED、capability缺失/null均被拒绝；old-model最新state缺失/null因确认数0被拒绝；更早history被有效最新sequence覆盖，符合当前latest-state设计。\n\n真实compiled PREFLIGHT_ONLY CLI也将坏基线标记 `ELIGIBLE_FOR_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW`，`missing=[]`，基线87表36行、`quick_check=ok`。该用例没有生成STOP grant，没有调用Commit，没有发native signal。完整baseline hash无法识别在preflight之前就存在的分类遗漏；Commit复用同一catalog是源码结论，不是已经执行的坏基线停止。\n\n最小修复路径为 `internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows.go` 和 `internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows_test.go`：将最新effect的缺失/null state明确计为不安全或拒绝，并保留最新sequence与subject约束。后续须验证坏基线真实preflight拒绝、0 STOP grant、0 native signal，以及原有效正向。\n\n## 已支持的修复和执行证据\n\n- 原STOP-R3-F01：可信owner明确为current operator/System/Administrators/TrustedInstaller；直接/继承的Everyone/Users危险ACE、unsupported/malformed ACE被拒绝。实际copied parent+child安全路径通过，D不可信安装继续拒绝。\n- 目录 `GENERIC_WRITE` 实际OPENED事实保留。持有该writer时选定ancestor rename仍被拒绝；final写入、删除、重命名、覆盖及同名替换拒绝。没有把OPENED当作替换成功或宣称目录完全不可写。\n- 自加native用例允许孤立FILE_ADD_SUBDIRECTORY，验证选定路径保留；INHERIT_ONLY在parent不生效但传播到final后被拒绝；即使ACL改后仍满足可信策略，ancestor/final同句柄SDDL漂移也被拒绝。\n- 原数值native proof修复：28项字段测试通过；真实missing-worker-exit preflight为STOP_UNAVAILABLE且未编译STOP grant。\n- Caller ctx/earlier deadline/final prewait取消三项native边界测试通过，durable claim/intent的synthetic journal检查通过。完整Commit在自身durable intent之后被取消仍为未执行的集成边界。\n- 自行构建两个不同grant CLI、独立C copied helper+child、D SQLite/data/operation：`STOPPED_LEASE_VERIFIED`，一次TerminateProcess，同一保留句柄观察exit `1381191507`，postflight87表35行且quick_check=ok；inspect/repeat commit结果及journal字节稳定。\n\n全19逐路径语义记录、源码SHA、case及capture引用见 `review.json`。历史worker/verifier凭据在这些用例中明确为synthetic；只有自己的copied Core真实native signal/wait被执行。\n\n## 证据边界和失败保留\n\n作者20个nonzero已逐条读stderr/stdout：4个cross-phase ACTION_DENIED得到独立确认，其余16个历史diagnostic原样保留（包括错误测试期待、路径、编码及harness失败），不抹去中途行为。Root已有22 mixed records（另含初始相邻E和未授权C根偏差），本轮不重新计数。作者后续C data/operation与amendment措辞的歧义单列；本轮data/operation全部位于获准D TMP。\n\n本轮所有失败、父/子命令退出均保存在diagnostic-ledger；一条PowerShell管道解析失败未进入child logger，其捕获缺口明确单列。工具模块/参数问题不是Source测试通过；新增安全断言失败归入STOP-R4-F01，不归为工具diagnostic。\n\n仍未覆盖：foreign-user token实际执行、hostile race穷尽、power-loss、full Commit intent后取消、所有深层SafetySnapshot分支。未碰实际Core/DB/API/keys/model，未新增proof class，未改Source/shared state，formal increment为0。Root单独决定采用，不签发自身接受或实际/正式完成。\n", "review_selected": {"verdict": "NEEDS_CHANGES", "findings": [{"id": "STOP-R4-F01", "severity": "P2", "status": "REPRODUCED_SOURCE_DEFECT", "title": "额外 MODEL effect 的 state 缺失或为 null 时被安全快照漏计", "locations": [{"path": "internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows.go", "line": 163}, {"path": "internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows.go", "line": 164}, {"path": "internal/ownedcorestop/stop_windows.go", "line": 119}, {"path": "internal/ownedcorestop/stop_windows.go", "line": 292}], "trigger": "原有效 old subject 已有一条 CONFIRMED MODEL effect；同 project/run 另有一个 effect_key 的最新记录 body={\"payload\":{\"capability\":\"MODEL\"}} 或 state:null，且该记录已存在于 preflight 基线。", "mechanism": "json_extract(...state) 返回 SQL NULL；NULL IN(...) 与 NULL != CONFIRMED 都不会成为 WHERE 的 true。因此额外行不计入 UnresolvedExternalEffects、NonModelEffects 或 ConfirmedModelEffects，原有 confirmed count 仍为1，ExactOldSubjectSafe 返回true。", "observed": "真实24-migration SQLite + reserved writer 两例复现；独立16项有限矩阵仅额外missing/null两项失败。真实 compiled PREFLIGHT_ONLY CLI 将包含此行的87表/36行/quick_check=ok基线标记ELIGIBLE_FOR_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW且missing为空。", "impact": "危险/未知effect不能被完整排除却可获得可审查的preflight eligibility。若状态在preflight前已存在，完整baseline hash一致不抵消该遗漏；Commit调用同一catalog，源码上存在相同遗漏。", "limits": "未为坏基线编译 STOP grant，未在坏基线执行 Commit 或 native signal；未修改或查询实际产品数据库。不能声称已观察到坏基线的真实停止。", "minimal_fix_paths": ["internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows.go", "internal/store/owned_stop_barrier_windows_test.go"], "minimal_fix": "对每个最新effect把缺失/null state作为不安全状态计数或显式拒绝，保留当前按effect_key最新sequence选择、唯一CONFIRMED MODEL计数和完整subject绑定。可用显式json_type检查/COALESCE或IS NOT语义，但必须拒绝missing/null并保留异常JSON类型拒绝。", "acceptance": "新增missing/null最新额外effect测试；复用有效positive与有限类型/history控制。真实坏基线preflight必须STOP_UNAVAILABLE或更早拒绝，零STOP grant/零native signal；修复者不得改原失败回执。", "evidence": [{"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\fixture-e2e-20261015T133636105720Z\\case-result.json", "sha256": "f5d991df8e33be370e3813046d2e2fd078b4a9d8669d2eb42e5777750da0a0e8", "bytes": 1201}, {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0039\\stdout.txt", "sha256": "36d3733ddea246c400d6b1bd4e9abc4d4b12f74ac041075c5c542a391ac2a300", "bytes": 8593}, {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0054\\stdout.txt", "sha256": "f97688a711d282d411552389b2554624b500f83f5ae7cb673269449f6e70ace5", "bytes": 9255}]}], "limits": ["Full live Commit cancellation/expiry after its own durable intent remains unexecuted. Fresh final-native cancellation seam and consumed-journal checks are compositional evidence only.", "No actual foreign-user token execution, adversarial concurrent race, power-loss, or exhaustive deeper SafetySnapshot qualification.", "Directory GENERIC_WRITE opened successfully in multiple native fixtures. Retained ancestor rename and selected final write/delete/rename/replacement were refused. OPENED is not claimed as replacement success or universal no-write guarantee.", "Isolated FILE_ADD_SUBDIRECTORY is accepted only when it is the only unsafe mask bit on that directory ACE. Native selected-path retention, safe-ACL drift and inherited-child refusal support bounded equivalence; trusted operator/elevated OS actors are not adversarially contained.", "Historical worker/verifier receipts in CLI fixtures are explicitly synthetic; only own copied Core native signal/wait is freshly observed.", "Finite history control confirms latest-sequence behavior; it does not certify all historical audit semantics, malformed JSON encodings, or every safety branch.", "No actual Core/DB/API/keys/model/boot proofclass operation or formal acceptance; Root alone may adopt review."]}, "review_fields": ["schema", "at", "verdict", "scope", "owner", "source_commit", "source_tree", "candidate_clean", "review_scope_sha256", "author_final2_manifest_sha256", "full19", "r4_delta_paths", "findings", "prior_r3_f01", "prior_required_fields", "prior_caller_context", "fresh_two_grant_positive", "fresh_bad_baseline_preflight", "finite_effect_matrix", "author_nonzero_review", "root_author_capture_verification", "fixture_lineage", "native_copy_pins", "native_acl_snapshot", "test_overlay", "store_overlay", "independent_extra_test", "independent_store_test", "fixture_archive", "capture_notes", "source_edits", "shared_state_edits", "actual_authority", "formal_increment", "parent_acceptance", "limits", "diagnostic_ledger", "command_index", "review_md"], "diagnostic_ledger": {"schema": "researchos.independent-diagnostic-ledger.v1", "reviewer_nonzero_command_records": 9, "records": [{"ordinal": 17, "native_exit": 1, "classification": "REVIEWER_TOOL_DIAGNOSTIC", "argv": ["powershell", "-NoProfile", "-Command", "Get-Acl -LiteralPath 'C:/Users/yqyyds/.codex/researchos-fixture-cache/owned-core-stop-r4-independent-review-20261015' | Select-Object Owner,Sddl | ConvertTo-Json -Compress"], "stdout": {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0017\\stdout.txt", "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "bytes": 0}, "stderr": {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0017\\stderr.txt", "sha256": "c131c313a1763ba4c64957484ae4c8bcb6190d6eadfaafec46e126f3735852ed", "bytes": 465}}, {"ordinal": 19, "native_exit": 2, "classification": "REVIEWER_TOOL_DIAGNOSTIC", "argv": ["C:/Users/yqyyds/.codex/researchos-fixture-cache/owned-core-stop-r4-independent-review-20261015/supervisor-review-v2.exe", "-test", ".v", "-test.run=TestOwnedImageOwnerAndACEAuthorization|TestOwnedImageRejectsUnsafeInstallationAndCopiedProcessACL|TestOwnedCoreAndParentImageAncestorsRetained|TestReview", "-test", ".timeout=60s"], "stdout": {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0019\\stdout.txt", "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "bytes": 0}, "stderr": {"path": "D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_stop_authority_revision04_independent_review_codex\\20261015-current-chat\\command-captures\\0019\\stderr.txt", "sha256": "c11b071a689399d84441a83a9ccda46eeabbac32868c4af24aa4a632b658d6f8", "bytes": 3180}}, {"ordinal": 28, "native_exit": 1, "classification": "EXPECTED_CROSS_PHASE_DENIAL", "argv": ["D:\\作品集\\ResearchOS\\research-os\\execution\\v2.4\\receipts\\W05\\W05-99\\owned_core_